{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35216","headline":"题贾氏林泉 · 聂夷中","name":"题贾氏林泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"市朝束名利，林泉系清通。\n岂知黄尘内，迥有白云踪。\n轻流逗密蓧，直干入宽空。\n高吟五君咏，疑对九华峰。\n我知种竹心，欲扇清凉风。\n我知决泉意，将明济物功。\n有琴不张弦，衆星列梧桐。\n须知澹泊听，声在无声中。\n地非樵者路，武陵又何逢。\n祗虑迷所归，池上日西东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}